# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# ObjectBox `objectbox-model.json` is NOT ignored. It is the schema registry:
# ObjectBox mints a UID for every entity/property/relation once and stores it
# there, and the native core matches by UID to migrate an existing database.
# Losing or regenerating it mints new UIDs and breaks every existing store.
# It MUST be committed. (ObjectBox's own note in the file says so.)
# See docs/data-conventions.md.
#
# `objectbox.g.dart` is pure generated Dart, derived from the model plus the
# entity classes. It is safe to ignore; run `make codegen` after checkout and
# after any entity change to produce it.
lib/objectbox.g.dart
